invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.h
catches: unit
reason: hspost_present_ticket takes a kept ticket of lifetime 0, which RFC
  9846 section 4.7.1 says to discard at once (rfc9846.txt:3258-3259). Its
  age of 0 is at or below that lifetime, so the hello offers it. The
  unit test's lifetime 0 row requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    if ((psk_len != SHA256_LEN && psk_len != HKDF_HASH_MAX) || saved->ticket.lifetime_s == 0) {
--- new
    if (psk_len != SHA256_LEN && psk_len != HKDF_HASH_MAX) {
